{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id403421722"}, "name":{"label":"you want a review.?!"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-26T12:38:23-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.120.0"}, "id":{"label":"14714868974"}, "title":{"label":"Terrible customer support"}, "content":{"label":"Nearly impossible to get in contact with hopper customer support. And when you do get in contact with them, they are unable to help. Terrible service. Paid to not even get service I paid for. Got denied and still had a really hard time getting in contact with their customer support team. After finally getting into contact, they were unable to even get into contact with their original merchant. This is ridiculous and I would never use their service again. This is the worst app ever. Just go thru the original merchant, the deals are not even good enough to go thru all this trouble if there are problems. You could spend $5 more with the original merchant or spend thousands for a terrible service with hopper. If i could give them 0 stars, i really would. And this isn’t the first time this has happened with them, it is the last and final straw for me.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904052407&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
