{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id593500176"}, "name":{"label":"Sean sps"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-22T21:14:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.120.0"}, "id":{"label":"14699791095"}, "title":{"label":"DECEPTIVE PRICING"}, "content":{"label":"Hopper likes to advertise a low price initially, and once you're interested in a property, they increase the price. Sometimes they tell you it's not available, so you have to upgrade to a higher-tier price room. They also don't fully disclose all of the resort fees except for in the fine print, so you think you're getting a good deal, but really you're getting hoodwinked.\n\nThe longer that you spend on the app, the higher the prices go. Sometimes, once you get to the very end of the checkout page, a property will say \"no longer available,\" so it's a waste of time. It's misleading, deceptive, and dishonest. This app does not belong on the App Store if they continue this deceptive activity.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904052407&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
